<title>SINGAPORE: Inno-Pac makes extraordinary gain.</title>
<headline>Inno-Pac makes extraordinary gain.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading-based Inno-Pacific Holdings Ltd said on Friday it would make an extraordinary gain of Singapore $8.6 million from the sale of its paper trading and distribution arm.</p>
<p>The sale of Intercontinental Forest Products Pte Ltd was completed on July 1 1996 and the extraordinary gain would be booked in the second half, said a company statement.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
